hypre: High performance preconditioners is developed by the  HYPRE Project Developers. The homepage of the project is: https://llnl.gov/casc/hypre the source code repo can be found here: https://github.com/hypre-space/hypre
The software is dual licensed: Apache-2.0 OR MIT
Hypre is a library of high performance preconditioners and solvers featuring multigrid methods for the solution of large, sparse linear systems of equations on massively parallel computers.

